{
  "an10.117:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 10.117 ",
  "an10.117:0.2": "12. The Ceremony of Descent ",
  "an10.117:0.3": "With Saṅgārava ",
  "an10.117:1.1": "Then Saṅgārava the brahmin went up to the Buddha, and exchanged greetings with him. ",
  "an10.117:1.2": "When the greetings and polite conversation were over, he sat down to one side and said to the Buddha: ",
  "an10.117:1.3": "“Worthy Gotama, what is the near shore? And what is the far shore?” ",
  "an10.117:1.4": "“Wrong view is the near shore, brahmin, and right view is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:1.5": "Wrong purpose is the near shore, and right purpose is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:1.6": "Wrong speech is the near shore, and right speech is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:1.7": "Wrong action is the near shore, and right action is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:1.8": "Wrong livelihood is the near shore, and right livelihood is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:1.9": "Wrong effort is the near shore, and right effort is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:1.10": "Wrong mindfulness is the near shore, and right mindfulness is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:1.11": "Wrong immersion is the near shore, and right immersion is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:1.12": "Wrong knowledge is the near shore, and right knowledge is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:1.13": "Wrong freedom is the near shore, and right freedom is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:1.14": "This is the near shore, and this is the far shore. ",
  "an10.117:2.1": "Few are those among humans ",
  "an10.1